    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d819">

                <pb facs="0700" n="624" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg624"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/20134</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-12-23T10:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 23, 1916, 10 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Information apparently reliable that Carranza troops evacuated and Villistas
                    entered Torreon yesterday.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
